/-! Lane owner:b-weighted-level-7, unit 2, segment 2c, piece 2 (GENERATED by `gen_dims.py`):
ONE fixed program `dimsProgram` on the local stack `NextDimsStages.DS 64`, the sequential
composition (charged handoffs, `BitMachineRawSequence.program`) of 63 arithmetic stages of
`NextDimsStages` followed by the charged clear of every cell of index `>= 11`.

From the bank with unary `lam s E cols b c nv rows t` in cells 0..8 and every other cell
blank, it halts on the SAME bank except cells 9 and 10, which hold unary `rowsOut x` and
`colsOut x`. For `x = dimsIn p (4 * bins p * V) (bins p * familySize p)` these are
`EffectiveIteration.nextRows p` and `EffectiveIteration.nextColumns p V` (`NextDimsEmbedT`).
No value is inserted; `t` is an INPUT cell: at the round point it is the admitted persistent
writer 16 (`stagePrefixRows = s * L`) and `nv` the admitted persistent writer 18 (`nv = 4*s*|V|`).
Variant of `NextDimsMachineT` reading `nv` instead of `V` (the `4*s*V` product is not recomputed). -/

namespace EthInapproximability.CurrentPaper.NextDimsMachineTN

open Turing BitMachineEncoding BitMachineStackEmbedding NextDimsStages

noncomputable section

